{
  "name": "Arrival Reminders (69d17ad052ce1aa21314280d)",
  "description": "I will check all active bookings (status = 'paid' or 'active_plan') and look up their trip's start_date. If the trip starts in exactly 30 days and reminder_sent_30d is not true, I will send an arrival_reminder email using the sendEmail function and mark reminder_sent_30d as true on the booking. If the trip starts in exactly 7 days and reminder_sent_7d is not true, I will send an arrival_reminder email and mark reminder_sent_7d as true on the booking.",
